Lock					loginctl lock-session
Sleep					systemctl suspend
Reboot					systemctl reboot
Power Off				systemctl poweroff
Bluetooth On			bluetoothctl power on
Bluetooth Off			bluetoothctl power off
Audio Combine Start		bash -c 'source "${HOME}/.local/bin/bash-functions" && audio-combine'
Audio Combine Stop		bash -c 'source "${HOME}/.local/bin/bash-functions" && audio-combine stop'
